flowchart LR
  U[Human / IdP<br/>OIDC + sender binding] --> G[Agent Gateway / PEP]
  W[SPIFFE Workload +<br/>artifact attestation] --> G
  AR[Agent Registry<br/>owner + lifecycle + review] --> G
  G --> A[Agent / LLM<br/>untrusted planner]
  A --> I[Typed Intent<br/>strict schema]
  I --> P[Context PDP<br/>OPA or Cedar]
  F[OpenFGA<br/>tenant + task relationship] --> P
  D[Delegation<br/>actions + resources + expiry] --> P
  P -->|Allow| T[Tool Router / commit PEP]
  P -->|Step-up| H[Exact Signed Approval]
  H --> T
  T -->|re-authorize| P
  T --> C[Claims API]
  T --> R[RAG + Memory<br/>pre-model filters]
  T --> M[MCP<br/>server + audience]
  T --> S[Sub-agent<br/>attenuated authority]
  T --> X[Payment API<br/>idempotency + receipt]
  G --> E[Hash-chained Evidence]
  P --> E
  T --> E
  RV[Revocation + risk signals] --> G
  RV --> P
